Original SPIKE ESC teaching examples — Apache-2.0

The back-EMF sensing and current-sensing decks, generated native project layouts,
dashboards and preparation/check script are original SPIKE material.

gate_miller_ringing.cir, two_wheeler_dashboard.spksch, ev_current_controller.c
and ev_motor_plant.cir are copied unchanged from
examples/spikes/advanced_systems/ in this repository. Their original scope and
limitations remain applicable. Generated gate_miller_ringing.spksch adds native
graphical wiring, saved probes and dashboard scopes using existing Studio APIs.

No VESC design, manufacturer model, vendor firmware, compiler or native library
is copied into this directory. These examples do not claim VESC endorsement.
